# Coding style & constraints

**Never** (unless asked): migrate framework; rename structure; change package manager (use npm); major dependency bumps; add Redis casually.

**Always:** minimal diffs; reuse components; mobile-first; vi/en i18n; Medusa admin `CLAUDE.md` rules; `useMedusaApi` for commerce.

See `.ai/CODE_STYLE.md`, `.ai/BUSINESS_RULES.md`.
